usage: python -m embodiment.cross_smoke [-h] --source SOURCE
                                        --dataset-a DATASET_A
                                        --dataset-b DATASET_B
                                        --pretrained PRETRAINED
                                        --output OUTPUT [--execute]
                                        [--timeout TIMEOUT]
                                        [--simulation-python SIMULATION_PYTHON]
                                        [--native-library NATIVE_LIBRARY]

Opt-in A-to-B G3 workflow. Dry-run never launches training or a simulator.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --source SOURCE
  --dataset-a DATASET_A
  --dataset-b DATASET_B
  --pretrained PRETRAINED
  --output OUTPUT
  --execute             opt in on an already approved GPU host; never
                        provisions hardware
  --timeout TIMEOUT
  --simulation-python SIMULATION_PYTHON
                        opt in to the final G3 physical gate with --execute
  --native-library NATIVE_LIBRARY
                        compiled embodiment/native C++ action boundary
